{
 "Background": {
  "Text": "Kinch spent 200 years as a jedi training droid on Coruscant, always knowing there had to\nbe a better target for his violence than the nice children he was tasked with fighting. One\nday he heard a master say, \"sometimes, one must take destiny into their own hands\" and\nhe had an epiphany - later that night, Kinch cornered the master alone and unarmed, and\nleft him covered in Discouraging Wounds before leaping out of a window into a speeder\nwhich was passing below by \"chance\". Ever since that night, Kinch has seized fate by the\nthroat in pursuit of proper opponents.",
